# GitHub's `.gitignore` templates for:
#
# 1. [C](https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/57286c3887203259752b747db94e6c3ad10ec53d/C.gitignore)
# 2. [C++](https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/57286c3887203259752b747db94e6c3ad10ec53d/C%2B%2B.gitignore)
# 3. [CMake](https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/57286c3887203259752b747db94e6c3ad10ec53d/CMake.gitignore)
# 4. [Ninja](https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/57286c3887203259752b747db94e6c3ad10ec53d/Global/Ninja.gitignore)
# 5. [Gcov](https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/57286c3887203259752b747db94e6c3ad10ec53d/Gcov.gitignore)

# Prerequisites
*.d

# Object files
*.o
*.ko
*.obj
*.elf

# Linker output
*.ilk
*.map
*.exp

# Precompiled Headers
*.gch
*.pch

# Libraries
*.lib
*.a
*.la
*.lo

# Shared objects (inc. Windows DLLs)
*.dll
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.app
*.i*86
*.x86_64
*.hex

# Debug files
*.dSYM/
*.su
*.idb
*.pdb

# Kernel Module Compile Results
*.mod*
*.cmd
.tmp_versions/
modules.order
Module.symvers
Mkfile.old
dkms.conf

# debug information files
*.dwo

